# Environment registry for set-context.sh
#
# Copy to environments.conf and edit cluster names / namespaces for your accounts.
#
# Format (10 fields):
#   index|label|auth_type|aws_profile|role_index|role_arn|region|cluster|namespace|context_alias
#
# auth_type:
#   adfs  — federated login via aws-login.sh (.env.local + ADFS)
#   keys  — long-term IAM access keys via aws-iam-login.sh (.env.iam.local)
#           role_index and role_arn are ignored for keys entries
#   local — localhost K3s cluster (no AWS login; uses local-k3s + project kubeconfig)
#
# role_arn: when non-empty, overrides role_index for aws-login.sh (ADFS only)
# context_alias: unique kubectl context name (use when cluster names repeat across accounts)
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored
# Legacy 9-field rows (no auth_type) still work and default to adfs
#
# Role index reference for ADFS (from .env.local):
#   0 = telcodrtotogipresales1 (617147411452)
#   1 = TotogiPS              (764119721991)
#   2 = BSSMagicStarhub       (298722972165)
#   3 = zainsudanbssmagic     (914357406961)
#
# Keys auth setup:
#   1. cp .env.iam.local template:  ./aws-iam-login.sh   (creates template on first run)
#   2. Set IAM_ACCOUNT_1_PROFILE, IAM_ACCOUNT_1_ACCESS_KEY_ID, IAM_ACCOUNT_1_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY
#   3. Add a keys row below whose aws_profile matches IAM_ACCOUNT_*_PROFILE

0|Totogi Presales|adfs|external-access|0|arn:aws:iam::617147411452:role/RAM-AWS-Prod-TelcoDR-telcodrtotogipresales1-Admin|us-east-1|CHANGE_ME_CLUSTER|nexus-ai-dev|presales-dev
1|TotogiPS Prod|adfs|external-access|1|arn:aws:iam::764119721991:role/RAM-AWS-Prod-TelcoDR-TotogiPS-Admin|ap-southeast-1|starhu-test|callsense-prod|totogips-callsense-prod
2|TotogiPS Dev|adfs|external-access|2|arn:aws:iam::764119721991:role/RAM-AWS-Prod-TelcoDR-TotogiPS-Admin|ap-southeast-1|starhu-test1|callsense-dev|totogips-callsense-dev
3|Starhub BSSMagic|adfs|external-access|2|arn:aws:iam::298722972165:role/RAM-AWS-Prod-Totogi-BSSMagicStarhub-Admin|us-east-1|prod-cluster|nexus-ai-prod|nexus-prod
4|Zain Sudan|adfs|external-access|3|arn:aws:iam::914357406961:role/RAM-AWS-Prod-Totogi-zainsudanbssmagic-Admin|ap-southeast-1|CHANGE_ME_CLUSTER|nexus-ai-dev|zain-dev

